                    <h5><b>Need Help Now?</b></h5>
<p>If you are in immediate need of help, please <a href="/find-your-local-chapter.html" target="Target" style="	font-weight: 300;
" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>contact your local Red Cross »</b></a><span style="	font-weight: 300;
"> or </span><a href="/get-help/disaster-relief-and-recovery-services/find-an-open-shelter.html" target="Target" style="	font-weight: 300;
