    <div class="section-control parbase">




<div id="-response" class="section-control-container  column-container    background-white top-padding-forty bottom-padding-twenty wide jump-link-target  gutter-twenty  " style="background-color: #ffffff" data-jump-text=" Response" data-jump-link-analytics="jump link not set" data-region-type="include" data-subsource-type="include">
    
    
    <div class="box-shadow-container">
        <div class="container-fluid main-content">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="par-50 col-md-6 section-par two-col-50-50 par-1">




    
    
    <div class="text parbase">
<div class="rich-text-editor-content columns-1" style="padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:10px; column-gap:0px;">
    <h5><b>We respond to an emergency about every 10 minutes.</b></h5>
<p>No one else does this: not the government, not other charities. From small house fires to multi-state natural disasters, the American Red Cross goes wherever we’re needed, so people can have clean water, safe shelter and hot meals when they need them most.</p>
<ul><li>We respond to an average of more than <span class="red-text"><b>60,000</b></span> disasters every year</li><li><span class="red-text"><b>95%</b></span> of our disaster relief workers are volunteers</li><li>The vast majority of disasters we respond to are home fires</li></ul>
<p> </p>

</div></div>


</div>
                    
                        <div class="par-50 col-md-6 section-par two-col-50-50 par-2">




    
    
    <div class="content-card-with-video">

<div class="content-card-video-main single hide-description hidden" data-source="vimeo" data-option="single" data-id="353388143">
    <div class="content">
        <div class="current-video-container">
            <div class="current-video-player"></div>
            <div class="current-video-header">
                <button class="current-video-preview" data-image-src="/content/dam/redcross/uncategorized/8/How-Red-Cross-responds-to-disasters-thumbnail2.jpg.transform/1288/q70/feature/image.jpeg" title="How the Red Cross Responds to Disasters. A United States map with houses on fire.">
                    <span class="play-button rco-ui-icon-play-icon hide-for-medium"></span>
                    <span class="hidden-off-screen">Play Video</span>
                </button>
                <div class="current-video-info   hide-for-small">
                    <span class="play-button rco-ui-icon-play-icon hide-for-small"></span>
                    <p class="current-video-title"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="current-video-caption single hide-description">
                <span class="counter"></span>
                <span class="description"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
