                <img loading="lazy" class="icon-list-image" src="/content/dam/redcross/brand-and-creative-marketing/icons/general/91-Cents-1000x1000-R-Pl.png.transform/282/q70/feature/image.png" alt="91 cents icon"/>
            </div>
            <div class="content content-block text">
                <div data-aa-icon-list="icon-list not set" class=" ">
                    <h5><b>Support Disaster Relief Efforts</b></h5>
<p>The Red Cross honors donor intent and all donations earmarked for Disaster Relief will be used to help people affected by disasters, big and small. Americans work hard for their money, and we’re committed to being the very best stewards of our donors’ dollar. <b>The Red Cross keeps our expenses low and an average of 91 cents of every dollar the Red Cross spends is invested in delivering care and comfort to those in need.</b></p>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
</div>
